OL,3,GNEWSABluebird at centre of new legal
OL,4,Adispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Campbell's Bluebird is at the
OL,7,Fcentre of a legal battle worth nearly
OL,8,F#150,000.
OL,10,FPaul Kinghan is seeking #147,162 from
OL,11,Fthe museum which houses the
OL,12,Fworld-famous hydroplane ` the Ruskin
OL,13,FMuseum in Coniston.
OL,15,FHe said this was the value of the items
OL,16,Fand cash he had provided to the museum
OL,17,Fin recent years which had not been
OL,18,Frepaid.
OL,20,FBut museum director Tracey Hodgson said
OL,21,Feverything Kinghan had provided to the
OL,22,Fmuseum had been given as donations.
